  "steps": [
    "Cover the flocão with water and the salt, stir and leave 15 minutes to hydrate, then put it in the blender.",
    "Bring the milk and oil to the boil, pour into the blender and blend with the flocão for 5 minutes.",
    "Transfer to a bowl, add the mozzarella and egg, then the polvilho gradually, kneading by hand when it gets thick.",
    "Roll into balls, coat in grated Parmesan and bake in a preheated oven at 180 °C for 25–30 minutes."
